WEBVTT

00:00:00.950 --> 00:00:04.310
Each project card in Orbit has a Complete
task button.

00:00:04.710 --> 00:00:07.990
Do the cards share one callback, or does each
get its own?

00:00:08.550 --> 00:00:12.550
Two functions can have identical code and
still be different objects.

00:00:12.790 --> 00:00:18.470
Find same reference shows which mounted
components hold the exact same function in
their props.

00:00:18.790 --> 00:00:21.230
Select the Customer portal card in the tree.

00:00:21.430 --> 00:00:25.910
In Props, choose Find same reference beside
onCompleteTask.

00:00:26.390 --> 00:00:31.590
Five instances hold this function: the three
project cards, the list, and its parent.

00:00:32.070 --> 00:00:33.990
Select Mobile app in the results.

00:00:34.390 --> 00:00:38.070
To see which card it represents, choose
Highlight on page.
